WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.086 --> 00:00:12.388
&gt;&gt;Tucker: A NEW ROYAL BABY IS

00:00:12.389 --> 00:00:12.855
COMING.

00:00:12.856 --> 00:00:15.592
THEY PLAN TO RAISE THEIR BABY IN

00:00:15.593 --> 00:00:17.594
A "GENDER FLUID" WAY.

00:00:17.595 --> 00:00:20.029
IT'S A DECISION THAT MORE AND

00:00:20.030 --> 00:00:22.298
MORE PARENTS ARE MAKING THESE

00:00:22.299 --> 00:00:22.599
DAYS.

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:25.034
TO EXPLAIN THE TREND, WE HAVE

00:00:25.035 --> 00:00:32.342
CATHY, OUR LIBERAL SHERPA,

00:00:32.343 --> 00:00:35.044
JOINING US TONIGHT.

00:00:35.045 --> 00:00:38.281
THE CORE IDEA AS I UNDERSTAND IT

00:00:38.282 --> 00:00:40.249
IS THAT SEX, MALE AND FEMALE

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:43.386
DECEMBER DESIGNATIONS, ARE

00:00:43.387 --> 00:00:44.420
CREATIONS OF SOCIETY.

00:00:44.421 --> 00:00:50.259
AND SO, YOU CAN KIND OF CHOOSE

00:00:50.260 --> 00:00:52.061
WHETHER YOUR CHILD IS A BOY OR A

00:00:52.062 --> 00:00:52.362
GIRL.

00:00:52.363 --> 00:00:53.730
IS THAT THE IDEA?

00:00:53.731 --> 00:00:55.765
&gt;&gt; THE CHILD WILL CHOOSE WHAT

00:00:55.766 --> 00:00:57.934
THE CHILD WANTS TO DO.

00:00:57.935 --> 00:01:02.338
WE ARE FACING A GENDERLESS

00:01:02.339 --> 00:01:05.875
FUTURE, GENDER-NEUTRAL FUTURE.

00:01:05.876 --> 00:01:09.912
MAINSTREAM MAGAZINES ARE COMING

00:01:09.913 --> 00:01:12.548
WITH UNISEX NAMES FOR CHILDREN,

00:01:12.549 --> 00:01:15.351
SO THEY CAN FIT INTO THIS FUTURE

00:01:15.352 --> 00:01:18.254
OF A GENDERLESS SOCIETY.

00:01:18.255 --> 00:01:27.397
&gt;&gt; LEAVING ASIDE THE SCIENTIFIC

00:01:27.398 --> 00:01:29.599
QUESTION OF WHETHER THIS IS

00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:29.932
FANTASY.

00:01:29.933 --> 00:01:30.466
&gt;&gt; IT IS REALITY.

00:01:30.467 --> 00:01:33.670
&gt;&gt; LET ME ASK YOU WHY YOU WOULD

00:01:33.671 --> 00:01:35.371
WANT A GENDERLESS SOCIETY.

00:01:35.372 --> 00:01:36.506
ISN'T IT THE WHOLE POINT THAT

00:01:36.507 --> 00:01:38.107
THE SEXES ARE DIFFERENT AND

00:01:38.108 --> 00:01:39.409
THAT'S A GOOD THING?

00:01:39.410 --> 00:01:41.310
WHY WOULD YOU WANT TO ELIMINATE

00:01:41.311 --> 00:01:42.845
THOSE DIFFERENCES?

00:01:42.846 --> 00:01:43.846
&gt;&gt; WE'RE ALWAYS TEACHING OUR

00:01:43.847 --> 00:01:46.049
CHILDREN TO BE WHO THEY WANT TO

00:01:46.050 --> 00:01:46.315
BE.

00:01:46.316 --> 00:01:50.420
WILL SMITH SAYS HIS SON IS

00:01:50.421 --> 00:01:51.020
FEARLESS.

00:01:51.021 --> 00:01:56.359
JADEN SMITH IS NOT AFRAID TO

00:01:56.360 --> 00:01:58.628
WEAR SKIRTS OR DRESSES.

00:01:58.629 --> 00:02:00.830
&gt;&gt; WE'RE NOT ENCOURAGING THEM TO

00:02:00.831 --> 00:02:02.532
BE UNIQUE.

00:02:02.533 --> 00:02:03.332
YOU JUST SAID WE'RE ENCOURAGING

00:02:03.333 --> 00:02:06.302
THEM TO BE ALL THE SAME, UNISEX.

00:02:06.303 --> 00:02:08.337
EVERYONE'S THE SAME, SEXLESS

00:02:08.338 --> 00:02:08.638
DRONE.

00:02:08.639 --> 00:02:11.407
&gt;&gt; NO, ABSOLUTELY NOT.

00:02:11.408 --> 00:02:12.175
&gt;&gt; OKAY.

00:02:12.176 --> 00:02:16.512
IT'S IN IGNORING DIFFERENCES,

00:02:16.513 --> 00:02:20.483
WE'RE ACCENTUATING DIFFERENCES?

00:02:20.484 --> 00:02:22.351
&gt;&gt; IF THE BOY WANTS TO WEAR A

00:02:22.352 --> 00:02:23.386
DRESS, THAT'S OKAY.

00:02:23.387 --> 00:02:25.888
THE GIRL DOESN'T WANT TO WEAR A

00:02:25.889 --> 00:02:27.690
DRESS AND PLAY WITH BARBIES,

00:02:27.691 --> 00:02:28.391
THAT'S OKAY.

00:02:28.392 --> 00:02:30.226
&gt;&gt; I'M NOT ARGUING WITH THAT.

00:02:30.227 --> 00:02:31.461
BUT I'M CONFUSED ABOUT THE

00:02:31.462 --> 00:02:33.630
DETAILS.

